All numbers are preserved: 46, six washers, 8, 12, 18 Harbor Street, 555-0148, 1 to 3, 4, 3:30, after 5, before 7 and noon. The hedges and the quoted email are intact; capitalizing the first word of the quote is fine.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3-train-slack-0090","row_sha256":"b4cbfd6820c447f7f1a184eb1b95d60184dd3a1a801c3bddfde85e02cf3b1dbf","critique":"This is an identity row: a timestamped thread that is already grammatical. The quotes, list, times and counts (44 inches, 18 pickups, seven) are all intact. The output is byte-identical.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3-train-slack-0107","row_sha256":"da6563664b98a227ccdcfd6731f6b0c0ed3d7ddb50071a3a6cc853c437ba6dd7","critique":"This is an identity row. The thread is grammatical, though it loosely mixes the 7:42 shift with the 7:42 train, which is plausible for commuter chat. The output is byte-identical.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"}]}
